        (T.Y c d G t t' j o (A.R.1 + s i) p - T.Y c d G t t' j o (A.R.1 + r i) p)‖ ^ 2 ≤
      T.slotVar (cslot c d ((T.desc c d t t').getD j (true, 0, none)).1)
